      "question_number": 4,
      "stem_markdown": "A company sells small and large bags of rice. The masses of the small bags of rice are normally distributed with mean 1.20 kg and standard deviation 0.16 kg.\n\nThe masses of the large bags of rice are normally distributed with mean 2.50 kg and standard deviation \\sigma kg. 20% of these large bags of rice have a mass less than 2.40 kg.",
